cy drives.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Ability to read and interpret electrical schematics and technical diagrams.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Strong troubleshooting and diagnostic skills for electrical systems.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Ability to work safely with industrial electrical equipment.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>Effective communication skills and the ability to understand technical instructions in English.</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong>ProRecruiters</strong> is part of <strong>Array Corporation</strong>, the leading technology-enabled workforce solutions company whose mission is to fix how work is bought, sold and delivered to enable access to the American Dream.</p><p><br></p><p><em>We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability or veteran status.</em></p><p><br></p><p>#PRLAB</p> ]]>
